* SPICE Netlist

* Voltage Source
V1 9 7 DC V_id

* Dependent Current Source
G1 2 5 9 7 Gm

* Resistor
R1 2 3 Ro

* Capacitor
C1 3 6 CL

* Node connections
* 1 is input positive
* 2 is connection between current source, resistor, and capacitor
* 3 is output node
* 5 is ground
* 6 is ground for the capacitor
* 7 is input negative
* 9 is connected to input positive and V_id